  "content": "<p>日光浴是一款简单的模组，为游戏添加了太阳与月亮的光束效果。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这些效果是简单的屏幕空间光束，通过Polytone模组利用原版后期着色器实现。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>需要安装Polytone</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1606/475/2026-03-30_22.png\" alt=\"光束效果\" width=\"1291\" height=\"664\"></p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://c.tenor.com/5GdQEu3luVUAAAAC/tenor.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"498\" height=\"280\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/788/551/polytone_banner2.png\" alt=\"需要Polytone\" width=\"800\" height=\"293\"></p>",
